    <string name="who_we_are">Who We Are</string>
    <string name="about_us_who_we_are">We’re a group of IT students from Cebu Institute of Technology University, working on building apps that offer something a little different. ZodiacHue is one of our projects, where we share daily quotes, readings, and lucky colors based on your zodiac sign.</string>
    <string name="about_us_our_approach">Coding is something we spend a lot of time on, whether it\'s for class or personal projects. We\'re always testing, debugging, and trying to make sure everything works smoothly so ZodiacHue feels effortless and enjoyable.</string>
    <string name="about_us_learning">Each project we take on helps us learn more, whether it\'s how to structure an app better or how to connect with users in a more meaningful way. We keep improving and picking up new skills as we go along.</string>
    <string name="about_us_vision">We\'re focused on making ZodiacHue a bright, calming companion in your daily routine—combining your zodiac hue, styling inspiration, and private daily reflections.</string>

